.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH voltkit-qr 1  "Voltkit 0.1.3" "Voltkit Manual"
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
voltkit\-qr \- Read QR codes from the screen or image files, or make them from text
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBvoltkit qr\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read QR codes from the screen or image files, or make them from text
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBvoltkit qr scan\fR
Select a screen region and copy the text of the QR code in it
.TP
\fBvoltkit qr read\fR
Print the text of every QR code in an image file
.TP
\fBvoltkit qr make [\-\-output]\fR
Show TEXT as a QR code in the terminal, or save it as a PNG image
.RS
\fB\-\-output\fR: Save a PNG image instead of printing to the terminal
.RE
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Copy the link from a QR code on screen:
.RS 4
.nf
\fBvoltkit qr scan\fR
.fi
.RE
.PP
Read the codes in a photo:
.RS 4
.nf
\fBvoltkit qr read photo.jpg\fR
.fi
.RE
.PP
Show a link as a QR code in the terminal:
.RS 4
.nf
\fBvoltkit qr make https://example.com\fR
.fi
.RE
.PP
Save a Wi\-Fi code to print:
.RS 4
.nf
\fBvoltkit qr make \*(AqWIFI:T:WPA;S:Home;P:secret;;\*(Aq \-\-output wifi.png\fR
.fi
.RE
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBvoltkit\fR(1)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
